# 中文: 后端 Python 工具链要求 LF；避免 Windows autocrlf 让 ruff format checkout 后变红。
# EN: Backend Python tooling expects LF; keep Windows autocrlf from breaking ruff format after checkout.
backend/**/*.py text eol=lf
backend/**/*.pyi text eol=lf
backend/**/*.toml text eol=lf
backend/**/*.yml text eol=lf
backend/**/*.yaml text eol=lf

# 中文: Trellis 规范是跨平台文本工件，统一 LF 便于审计 diff。
# EN: Trellis specs are cross-platform text artifacts; LF keeps review diffs stable.
.trellis/**/*.md text eol=lf
